{
 "name": "Encoder",
 "_note": [
  "Encoder colour theme, after the OP-1: colour means 'the encoder of this colour moves this'.",
  "Hues are the OP-1's (blue, green, orange, white), ordered dark to light like the OP-XY's grey knobs,",
  "so encoder 4 stays white and the physical knobs still read correctly. Everything else is a",
  "barely warm neutral ramp: structure and illustration carry no colour. Red is kept for record/alerts."
 ],
