  "_note": [
   "Per-screen art direction: individual elements coloured for what they are or what they show.",
   "White and black stay wherever they help the picture. Knob hues come from encoders.json as enc1..enc4.",
   "Rule syntax: opxy_theme.py docstring. Exemplar screens first (2026-10-25).",
   "Device test 2026-10-26: the OS repaints hardsync's beam (palette table grey2..7) and prism's rays (nearest-palette snap) at runtime, so those rules show nothing on the device; kept as placeholders for the patched-OS rung."
